## 1. PRODUCT GOAL

Upgrade the existing MAXNET5G Android app with a smart, fully automatic "Free VPN" feature.

The user opens the app, taps ONE button, and the app automatically:
1. Retrieves a fresh list of public free VLESS / VMess / Trojan (including Reality) configurations.
2. Tests them on the user's own device with the existing Xray core.
3. Ranks them by real measured performance (never by country or location).
4. Connects through the best working one using the existing VPN engine.
5. Keeps the connection alive: automatic failover to the next best server and automatic reconnection.

The user never sees or chooses servers, countries, protocols or configurations.

Acceptance narrative (the feature is done only when all of this is true on a real device):
- Fresh install with network: tap Connect -> connected within the target time (section 14) -> exit IP
  differs from the direct IP -> other apps' traffic flows through the tunnel.
- The chosen server is made unreachable while connected -> the app notices and moves to another server
  by itself within the failover budget.
- Airplane mode on/off or Wi-Fi <-> mobile data switch -> the app recovers by itself and does NOT
  switch servers needlessly.
- App started offline but a cache exists -> Connect still works from the cache.
- Every existing feature behaves exactly as before.

